## Web search

Fallback chain, in order, for any web search or page fetch:

1. `mcp__exa__*` (`web_search_exa`, `web_fetch_exa`).
2. `WebSearch`, when the Exa tools are absent from the tool list or return an auth, rate-limit or transport error.
3. `WebFetch` on a known URL, when `WebSearch` cannot answer.

When you fall back, say so in one line. Never retry a failing Exa call more than once.

